Result: vendor (ahmed.khan@demo.com / owner) signed in -> token minted -> reached dashboard
(low-stock business notification rendered normally). No new exception. ui_errors clean.
PerfHttp.start/stop wrap each call additively; no PerfHttp/HttpMetric error in logcat.

PII NOTE: Authorization header is masked (Authorization: ***/Bearer 0zfktse...) in the api_client
log (NEARS-463). VendorApp endpoints do not put token in the URL, but PerfHttp.sanitizeUrl still
reduces any URL to scheme://host/path before the HttpMetric, so no query/userinfo can leak.
